1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Someone is out there

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
running around
and disabling my puppets.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Can you go and kill them?

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Yes, you can count on me.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
I'll take all of 'em down.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
[opening theme music playing]

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

9
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
[singer singing in English]

10
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

11
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
TRACKING X AND X PURSUIT

12
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,000
[Knuckle] He's close.

13
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
[Shoot] Very well.

14
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
He's still on the road.

15
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,000
If he stays the course,

16
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,000
he'll pass by here
in ten minutes.

17
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
[Shoot] Do you really think
he'll stick to the road?

18
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,000
[Knuckle] No.
He'll notice my presence

19
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,000
just before he gets here,

20
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,000
announces accumulated interest
every ten seconds,

21
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:46,000
and A.P.R. informs the enemy
interest will be accrued,

22
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,000
but the count is interrupted

23
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,000
if the target gets more than
100 meters away from Knuckle.

24
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,000
The remaining time
is then stored,

25
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,000
saved in A.P.R.'s memory,

26
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
and then as soon as the target

27
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,000
gets within a 100-meter radius
of Knuckle once again,

28
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:07,000
the count picks up
exactly where it left off.

29
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:13,000
[Knuckle] He's approaching at
a speed between 160 to 180 kph.

30
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
If there are still
three seconds or more

31
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
before A.P.R.
adds interest again,

32
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,000
[Shoot] What's wrong?

33
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,000
[Knuckle] Damn it.
What just happened?

34
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,000
He changed direction
at the last second!

35
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,000
-[Shoot] Huh?
-[Knuckle] There!

36
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,000
-[Shoot] Calm down.
-[growls]

37
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,000
It's not worth it.

38
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,000
He has the speed of a cheetah.

39
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
We'll never catch up.

40
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,000
[Knuckle] He's not supposed
to know how to deal with Zetsu.

41
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,000
How the hell did he
discover our ambush?

42
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,000
Wait.

43
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:28,000
There's no point in doing more work
than absolutely necessary.

44
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,000
[Flutter] Right.

45
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,000
It appears
that they were attempting

46
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
to ambush sir Cheetu.

47
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:36,000
[Leol] Oh. So he's in the area?

48
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,000
[Flutter] I warned sir Cheetu
before he ran into their trap.

49
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,000
Was that unnecessary?

50
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
[Leol] What did he do?

51
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,000
[Flutter] He took a detour
toward the capital.

52
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:50,000
He told me that I should
thank you for the help.

53
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,000
[Leol] I see. Good work.

54
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:55,000
He owes me one now.

55
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:58,000
[cellphone rings]

56
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,000
Leol here.

57
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:02,000
[Neferpitou] The target
just engaged a squad of soldiers

58
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,000
in the city of Luonton.

59
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,000
[Leol] Luonton?

60
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:09,000
Start preparing an ambush
to the north of them.

61
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,000
They've had to stay
in one particular area

62
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
for longer than expected, meow.

63
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,000
We should all bear in mind
that they have been

64
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,000
constantly on the move
for more than 30 hours straight.

65
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:32,000
[tense music playing]

66
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:41,000
-[man 1] Liar!
-[man 2] Rebel scum!

67
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,000
as many puppets
and soldiers as I can.

68
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:04,000
Well, should I try heading north?

69
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,000
[Gon] I knew it.
Someone's still following me.

70
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Who's there?
Come out, and show yourself!

71
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,000
[footsteps stop]

72
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:24,000
[Gon] The presence is gone.

73
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,000
It might just be following me
until more ants show up.

74
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,000
-[Leol] Hey.
-Hey.

75
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:41,000
[Leol] Sorry that I
had to stop you.

76
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,000
[Cheetu] Nah. I was
already headed this way.

77
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,000
Is the king this direction, Hagya?

78
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,000
[growls]

79
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:56,000
[Cheetu] Flutter's warning
was a really big help to me.

80
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:59,000
I'm trying to avoid
getting into fights right now.

81
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:03,000
[Leol] Glad to hear it.
By the way, what's that thing?

82
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:12,000
It just follows me
wherever I run to.

83
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,000
I guess I'm stuck with it,

84
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,000
I said, you want it gone?

85
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,000
You can do that?

86
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
Probably.

87
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,000
But it'll cost me?

88
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:38,000
[Leol] The royal guard
has assigned me a mission.

89
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,000
I'd like your help on it.

90
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
-[Flutter] Sir Leol.
-[Leol] Hmm?

91
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
[Flutter] I've spotted the target.

92
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,000
He's headed north on the road

93
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:48,000
through the forest
northeast of Luonton.

94
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
It seems
that Lord Neferpitou's hunch

95
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,000
was right on the money.

96
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,000
You said he's a Hunter?

97
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:12,000
They can be pretty difficult
to deal with.

98
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,000
I know. I've planned ahead.

99
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Okay.

100
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,000
With any luck,
you can master it in a day.

101
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,000
I'm a slow learner,

102
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,000
[Cheetu] When you
put it like that, sure.

103
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:58,000
I'll have my underlings
determine the prey's abilities.

104
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Yeah, I guess I owe you one.

105
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:17,000
[Cheetu] Sounds like you're
looking to reclaim your throne.

106
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:22,000
[Killua] Damn it.
I'm being followed.

107
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,000
And he's way out of yo-yo range.

108
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:28,000
If I don't lose him or beat him,
I'm in trouble.

109
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
[Killua] The canopy leaves
are dense enough

110
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:40,000
that he shouldn't be able
to see me from the air,

111
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:44,000
and if he comes down here,
he'll be in range of my yo-yo.

112
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:49,000
[Killua panting]

113
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:23,000
[Killua] Something's coming
from the opposite side,

114
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,000
and it's on the ground.

115
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,000
[gasps]

116
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Huh?

117
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,000
[Beetle Ant] Huh?

118
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:52,000
-[Monkey Ant] Aha!
-[Chimera Ants yell]

119
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,000
[neck cracks]

120
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,000
-[Monkey Ant] No!
-[Killua yelps]

121
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Retreat! Time to regroup!

122
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:40,000
[Beetle Ant laughing]

123
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,000
Well, what do you say, kid?

124
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,000
How'd you like that blast?

125
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:05,000
No, there's a bigger problem.

126
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:08,000
I completely concealed my presence
and attacked from his blind spot,

127
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,000
but he countered
at the perfect time.

128
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,000
Someone must be
feeding him information.

129
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,000
It's him.

130
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:21,000
He's probably
watching right now.

131
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,000
I'd guess he's got a power that
lets him pinpoint my location.

132
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:35,000
I don't want them to know about
my electro-shocks, or my yo-yo.

133
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:39,000
I'd like to shake them off
and go back to hiding,

134
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:41,000
but that won't work.

135
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,000
I'll have
to beat them all without…

136
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,000
No. There's something
stuck to my face.

137
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,000
[flea chatters]

138
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,000
[Killua] A flea?

139
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,000
[dramatic music playing]

140
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,000
[Flutter] Area TH-88,

141
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:19,000
X-15, Y-12, Z-2.

142
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:23,000
Point X-9, Y-3, Z-1.

143
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,000
[beeping]

144
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:36,000
♪ There's no escaping ♪

145
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,000
[flea chatters]

146
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,000
[Killua] Damn it!

147
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:52,000
My temple won't stop bleeding.

148
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:05,000
Point Y-5, X-3, Z-1.

149
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:07,000
Okay.

150
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
[inhales]

151
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,000
[Killua yelps]

152
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:36,000
[Sniper humming]

153
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:40,000
♪ My fleas are so special ♪

154
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:42,000
♪ So very, very special ♪

155
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:46,000
They have
a 200-meter vertical leap.

156
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,000
♪ Oh, yeah ♪

157
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:24,000
[suspenseful music playing]

158
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:31,000
[Flutter] Ah.
He's going to try something.

159
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:33,000
He may try to use his ability.

160
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,000
[Sniper] Yeah.

161
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:37,000
[Flutter] Let's see
what he can do.

162
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,000
[Sniper] Okay.

163
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:41,000
[inhales]

164
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Nothing you can do
can escape my sight.

165
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:03,000
So come on. Do something!

166
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:17,000
[dramatic music playing]

167
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:19,000
[narrator] Killua cannot use En.

168
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:31,000
Killua knows this and keeps his
aura within a manageable range,

169
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:34,000
just 57 centimeters
from his body.

170
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:39,000
is within that range,

171
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Killua must rely
on his incredible reflexes

172
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:46,000
as well as his strength
to react with desperate speed

173
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:50,000
and dodge the enemy's attack
at point-blank range.

174
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,000
The margin of error

175
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:54,000
is unfortunately
all but nonexistent.

176
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,000
But this time,
he did not dodge it.

177
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:06,000
This way, he could determine
the bullet's trajectory.

178
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,000
[grunts]

179
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
Damn it.

180
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,000
It came from this way!

181
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,000
[dramatic music playing]

182
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:16,000
[Flutter] Ah.
He allowed himself to be hit

183
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:18,000
so he could locate the sniper.

184
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:23,000
The target is heading your way,
and quickly!

185
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,000
[Sniper] Okay.

186
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:30,000
♪ This is all
Within expected parameters ♪

187
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,000
[Killua] The bleeding's
completely stopped

188
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,000
You like that?

189
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:00,000
Now there's
nowhere for you to hide,

190
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,000
so come on out!

191
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,000
[Meleoron] Wait!

192
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:18,000
The desert is massive.

193
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:22,000
If you don't have any water,
you'll die of thirst in a day.

194
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:29,000
-[footsteps]
-[gasps]

195
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,000
[Meleoron] Aw, man.

196
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,000
I wanted to observe you
a little longer,

197
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:36,000
but I guess that won't work.

198
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:46,000
First, introductions.

199
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,000
Hello. My name is Jail…

200
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:51,000
Uh, I mean call me Meleoron.

201
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:55,000
I was a squadron leader
when the Queen was alive.

202
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,000
Nice to meet you.

203
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:58,000
And what's your name?

204
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,000
Why were you following me?

205
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:04,000
Because I didn't
want you getting away,

206
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,000
and I sure couldn't
just let you die,

207
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:21,000
[gasps]
I almost let it slip.

208
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,000
He approached me
with an ulterior motive.

209
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,000
-[Gon] "You guys"?
-[Meleoron gasps]

210
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:34,000
[laughs]
Yeah, that's right.

211
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:42,000
[Meleoron gasps]

212
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:44,000
[Gon] And you picked me
over Killua.

213
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,000
Thought I'd put up
less of a fight, didn't you?

214
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,000
[Meleoron] Huh? Wait!
You've got it all wrong!

215
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Is that how it sounded?

216
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,000
Okay, that makes sense.

217
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,000
I mean, I know what I look like.

218
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,000
You think I'm an enemy.

219
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:59,000
Guess I should have been
more clear about that.

220
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,000
Listen, I swear I'm not lying!

221
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:06,000
I'm not looking to trick
or defeat you, okay? Promise.

222
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:23,000
[Killua] Is that him?

223
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,000
[dramatic music playing]

224
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,000
♪ It's a trap ♪

225
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:45,000
♪ Come on in if you wanna ♪

226
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,000
[Ikalgo]
He went for the kill

227
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:55,000
instantly and
without hesitation.

228
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:57,000
I'm impressed.

229
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:59,000
[gags]

230
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,000
[Killua] A lake?

231
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:23,000
It's Captain Ikalgo's host!

232
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,000
[Fish Ant 1]
Stop eating it, damn it!

233
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:29,000
[Fish Ant 2] Look,
I want to stop, but I can't!

234
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:31,000
[Fish Ant 1]
The blood is calling us!

235
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
[closing theme music playing]

236
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:01,000
[narrator] Killua's opponent is Ikalgo,

237
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:03,000
a Chimera Ant
resembling an octopus

238
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:06,000
that uses human hosts.

239
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:09,000
[Ikalgo]
Don't call me an octopus!

240
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

241
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:31,000
[dramatic music playing]

242
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Gon] Next time,
"Ikalgo and Lightning."
